  "title": "Napoleon Bonaparte",
  "summary": "Napoleon Bonaparte was born on 15 August 1769 in Ajaccio, Corsica. He rose swiftly after the French Revolution, became a general in 1793 and First Consul after the coup of November 1799. In May 1804 he became Emperor of the French and set out to conquer Europe. After his final defeat he was exiled to St Helena, where he died on 5 May 1821.",
